1209 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 200 0 R
/T (This guide was never about perfection. It was never about creating a quiet mind or a finished, healed version of you. It's about building a relationship with your mind, one that is gentle, forgiving, and understanding. How you choose to act. The words you say to yourself. The story you decide to keep telling. That shift doesn't require a perfect morning routine or a life without stress, it just requires you, choosing yourself again. Some days that will be a full practice. Some days it's one kinder thought, one promise kept to yourself. Both count. Both are the work. You always had the only tool you needed. You're already using it.)
/E (This guide was never about perfection. It was never about creating a quiet mind or a finished, healed version of you. It's about building a relationship with your mind, one that is gentle, forgiving, and understanding. How you choose to act. The words you say to yourself. The story you decide to keep telling. That shift doesn't require a perfect morning routine or a life without stress, it just requires you, choosing yourself again. Some days that will be a full practice. Some days it's one kinder thought, one promise kept to yourself. Both count. Both are the work. You always had the only tool you needed. You're already using it.)
/Pg 46 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
