4612 0 obj
<<
/Title (So I need you to hear this: your ability to feel, to empathize, to care deeply, that is one of the most beautiful things about you. Big emotions aren't a malfunction. They're information, messengers knocking to tell you something matters. The goal was never to feel calm all the time. It's to stop being afraid of your own feelings, so they can move through you instead of running the show.)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 4604 0 R
/Next 4621 0 R
>>
