4621 0 obj
<<
/Title (Most of us were taught two options: explode or numb. But there's a third way nobody teaches, feel it, on purpose, with support. Emotions are like waves. They rise, they crest, and if you let them, they pass. Numbing doesn't end the wave; it just makes you brace against it forever.)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 4612 0 R
/First 4631 0 R
/Last 4632 0 R
/Count -2
/Next 4633 0 R
>>
endobj
4622 0 obj
<<
/Title (Here's what that means in practice: you decide who you're becoming, and then you let small actions cast votes for that person. Every time you show up, even imperfectly, even just a little, you're casting a vote. And when you miss a day?  The only rule that matters is never miss twice. One off day doesn't break the habit. It's what you do next that counts.)
/Dest [31 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 4634 0 R
/First 4635 0 R
/Last 4636 0 R
/Count -2
/Next 4613 0 R
>>
